      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-cv",
      "description": "The page's one primary action, in the top bar next to the theme switch; the only accent on the first screen.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-cv\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5\"/><path d=\"M9 13h6M9 16.5h4\"/></svg><span>CV</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-cv{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;height:2.25rem;padding:0 .95rem 0 .8rem;font:550 .92rem/1 var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--accent,#006967);text-decoration:none;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#006967) 70%,var(--bg,#fbfdfd));border-radius:999px;transition:border-color .2s,background-color .2s}.ds-btn-cv:hover{border-color:var(--accent,#006967);background:var(--accent-soft,#d5f2f0)}.ds-btn-cv:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#006967);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon button",
