      "refersTo": "link",
      "description": "Every link is Deep Teal and underlined, so no link depends on colour alone.",
      "html": "<p class=\"ds-text\">Read the <a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"#\">PDF</a> or download the <a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"#\">BibTeX</a>.</p>",
      "css": ".ds-text{font:400 1.0625rem/1.6 var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#101d21)}.ds-link{color:var(--accent,#006967);text-decoration:underline 1px;text-underline-offset:.2em;text-decoration-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#006967) 45%,transparent)}.ds-link:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#006967);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Top-bar navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-link",
      "description": "Muted section links; the section in view turns ink with a 2px Deep Teal underline. Scrolls sideways on phones and keeps the current link in view.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Sections\"><a href=\"#\">Research</a><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"true\">Publications</a><a href=\"#\">Awards</a><a href=\"#\">Teaching</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:1.35rem;font:500 .92rem/1 var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-nav a{padding:.35rem 0;color:var(--muted,#4f5e62);text-decoration:none}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--ink,#101d21)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=true]{color:var(--ink,#101d21);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent,#006967)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quick facts card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "The one card on the first screen: hairline border, 6px corners, a serif title and label/value pairs computed from the content files.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-facts\"><h2>Quick facts</h2><dl><div><dt>Ph.D. completion</dt><dd>Expected December 2027</dd></div><div><dt>Publications</dt><dd>6 papers: 5 ICML, 1 AIJ</dd></div></dl></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-facts{width:16rem;background:var(--card,#fff);border:1px solid var(--faint,#d4dfdf);border-radius:6px;padding:1.1rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;font-family:var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-facts h2{margin:0 0 .85rem;font:500 1.1rem/1.2 var(--serif,'Newsreader',Georgia,serif);color:var(--ink,#101d21)}.ds-facts dl{display:grid;gap:.75rem;margin:0}.ds-facts dt{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink,#101d21)}.ds-facts dd{margin:.05rem 0 0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted,#4f5e62)}"
    },
