      "refersTo": "publication",
      "description": "Signature component: muted label (C5) on the date column, serif title, authors with your name underlined in Deep Teal, bold venue, underlined links.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pub\"><a class=\"ds-pub-label\" href=\"#\">C5</a><div><p class=\"ds-pub-title\">Online Compatible Reward Identification from Preference Feedback</p><p class=\"ds-pub-authors\"><strong>Simone Drago</strong>, Marco Mussi, Alberto Maria Metelli</p><p class=\"ds-pub-meta\"><b>ICML 2026</b><a href=\"#\">PDF</a><a href=\"#\">PMLR</a><a href=\"#\">BibTeX</a></p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pub{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:1rem;align-items:baseline;font-family:var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);max-width:40rem}.ds-pub-label{justify-self:end;font:650 .86rem/1 var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--muted,#4f5e62);text-decoration:none}.ds-pub-title{margin:0;font:500 1.2rem/1.3 var(--serif,'Newsreader',Georgia,serif);color:var(--ink,#101d21);text-wrap:balance}.ds-pub-authors{margin:.3rem 0 0;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted,#4f5e62)}.ds-pub-authors strong{color:var(--ink,#101d21);font-weight:650;text-decoration:underline 2px var(--accent,#006967);text-underline-offset:.22em}.ds-pub-meta{margin:.3rem 0 0;font-size:.93rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.2rem .85rem;color:var(--ink,#101d21)}.ds-pub-meta b{font-weight:600}.ds-pub-meta a{font-weight:550;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--accent,#006967);text-underline-offset:.2em;text-decoration-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#006967) 45%,transparent)}"
